00:26:41.730 --> 00:26:57.000
<v Michael Lewis>It's insane. The time and money now being spent to ensure the fairness of what, after all, is just a basketball game-- a bajillion miles of fiber optic cable connect this room directly to the NBA arenas around the country, all for two calls a game.
<v Michael Lewis>这太疯狂了。现在投入时间和金钱来确保公平——毕竟这只是一场篮球比赛——数以亿计的光纤电缆直接将这个房间连接到全国各地的NBA场馆，全部只是为了每场比赛的两次判罚。

00:26:57.000 --> 00:27:06.060
<v Joe Borgia>At two calls a game-- $15 million to build this room to get two calls during the game. But you gotta do it. You gotta do it.
